Error [E0905]: `Decimal` isn't `Comparable`
  --> tests/ui/operator_float_comparable_bound.jet:3:18
    |
  3 | fn run() { print(less(1.0, 2.0)) }
    |                  ^^^^
 Why: `Decimal` would need to implement `Comparable` before it can be used here
 Fix: Write `#Comparable` before `Decimal`, or use `sort_by` with a key
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0905
